    "Native 3.8.1 classes/class-custom-post-type.php:200,223 declares hierarchical categories and flat tags. Both are unregistered while portfolio content is disabled; these exact declarations let the engine bound its taxonomy cache roster when re-enabling settings.",
    "The archive page and placeholder are post references. _vp_post_type_mapped is derived from the archive option; treating each marker as authored leaves the old target marker outside outbound scope closure.",
    "The native archive page-size and seven image-width settings are numeric controls (classes/class-settings.php:287, 434-485), not post identities. Their narrow lint_ok reviews preserve string values even when they coincide with real post IDs.",
